losed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-07-04T11:02:55Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T15:56:26Z","closed_at":"2025-07-28T15:56:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108271","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108271","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108271.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108271.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-28T15:56:21Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\nRight now, the class description states:\r\n\r\n> **Note:** Reflection probes are only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility.\r\n\r\nThis has been fixed in Godot 4.3 ( #88056 ) and the documentation page has been [updated](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/pull/10830), but the class page remains unfixed. This PR aims to fix this by changing the third paragraph in the class page:\r\n\r\n> **Note:** Reflection probes are only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility. When using the Mobile rendering method, only 8 reflection probes can be displayed on each mesh resource. Attempting to display more than 8 reflection probes on a single mesh resource will result in reflection probes flickering in and out as the camera moves.\r\n\r\nto this:\r\n\r\n> **Note:** When using the Mobile rendering method, only 8 reflection probes can be displayed on each mesh resource, while the Compatibility rendering method only supports up to 2 reflection probes on each mesh. Attempting to display more than 8 reflection probes on a single mesh resource using the Mobile renderer will result in reflection probes flickering in and out as the camera moves, while the Compatibility renderer will not render any additional probes if more than 2 reflection probes are being used.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108271/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108271/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}